{
	"info": {
		"_postman_id": "b1a2c3d4-e5f6-7890-abcd-ef1234567890",
		"name": "Book Bus API",
		"description": "Complete Postman Collection for the Bus Ticket Booking System API.\n\n## Setup\n1. Import this collection\n2. Run **Register Passenger** → copy the token into `auth_token` collection variable\n3. Login as admin (seeded in DB) → copy token into `admin_token`\n4. Follow the numbered booking steps: Browse → Seat Map → Preview → Confirm\n\n## Changes from Bug Fixes\n- Public registration no longer accepts `role` field — all new accounts are passengers\n- Admin accounts must be seeded directly in the database\n- Booking conflict errors now return `conflicting_seats` array\n- Get/Cancel Booking by reference requires auth if the booking was made by a logged-in user\n- Schedule creation rejects past dates and zero-duration trips\n- Route creation rejects identical origin and destination\n- Invalid `?date=` filter now returns 400 instead of 500",
		"schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
	},
